{"id":"altura","lemma":"altura","pos":"noun","rank":1638,"glosses":["height","altitude","heaven"],"ipa":"/alˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"alturas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-altura.wav","examples":[{"text":"No te dan miedo las alturas, ¿verdad?","en":"You aren't afraid of heights, are you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/532160","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"dan"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"¿A qué altura puedes saltar?","en":"How high can you jump?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453565","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to jump"}]},{"text":"¿Cuál es la altura de aquella torre?","en":"How tall is that tower?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68232","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that (over there","l":"aquel"},{"g":"tower"}]},{"text":"A estas alturas ya deberías saberlo.","en":"You should know that by now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642333","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"now"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"}]},{"text":"No me encuentro bien a tanta altura.","en":"I don't feel well at such a high altitude.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"encounter, meeting"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"copy","l":"tanto"},null]}]}